        "Description": "Hiya 47\rWe have been hired by the Guards of the prison Cold Blooded Citadel\r\rThey have locked up a dangerous person in the prison to prevent them from using a private exploit to permacrash the server\r\rHowever the guards seen that a group of people been plotting to escape the prison via chunk regen, and are planning on taking the hokoido medical facility hostage to gain the funds for the thousands of books needed\r\rAct fast\rThe fate of the server depends on you",
